WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:45.960
Drama Club Room

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.500
You are going on a journey,

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:53.090
and leaving me behind, all alone.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.260
But I'll be just fine.

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:58.930
Because this road continues right to you!

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:00.470
So I'll be able to keep waiting for you.

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:13.270
As long as my memories of you remain in my heart, I will wait for you beneath this tree!

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:24.660
Um... How was that?

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:27.790
Magnificent!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.790
You're amazing, Amamiya-san!

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:29.710
You're like a goddess of the stage!

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:31.290
It's like watching an angel!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:32.790
Oh, no...

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.130
You're exaggerating.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:39.430
I knew my instincts were right.

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:49.020
An Exciting Instant

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:54.020
Chairman's Office

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:53.690
I see.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:57.860
So, you want to set up a giant tent on campus.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.070
Yes.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:05.240
I've planned many events in the past, and even I thought it was a very interesting idea.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:09.910
But still, I think it would be too big.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:14.040
Like I said, in order to reflect the enormous scale of the plans,

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:19.170
special consideration could be made for Year 2 Class A to present its cooperative masterpiece...

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:23.930
As the vice principal, I can't approve your proposal.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:28.680
As students, how will you manage building such a thing?

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.650
Well, everyone's motivated, so we'll work it out somehow...

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:36.900
No matter how motivated you are, I can't approve such an unreasonable request!

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:42.570
As long as my eyes are black, yes, as the vice principal, I...

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.120
Will it be safe?

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:47.120
Huh?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:52.870
I'm asking if your tent will be safe after its completion.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.500
Yes! Of course!

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.840
There won't be any problems!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:58.800
Understood.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:00.130
Ultra Haunted House

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:01.010
APPROVED

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:05.510
I'm expecting a lot from you.

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:06.470
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.930
Now, who's going to take responsibilty for it?

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.930
Aoba Riku-kun, of course!

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.730
Uh... yes, I will!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:14.690
I'll work hard on it!

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.190
Understood.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.940
Aoba Riku-kun, make sure you do a good job.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:23.780
I approved your proposal, so I won't allow you to cut any corners.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.070
Excuse us!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:27.450
Riku-kun!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.490
What happened? What did the principal say?

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:30.450
Look!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:31.580
It's approved.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.080
All right!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.120
They did it!

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.080
We barely managed to decide on something.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.540
I wondered there for a minute.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:41.550
Anyway, we've got to start getting ready right now.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.680
Yeah. There's not much time until the Culture Festival.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.180
Okay, Aoba-kun.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:47.180
Work hard on the rest.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.470
Thanks for your support, Sakurai-kun.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.980
We don't have much time to set up a tent.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.230
We're counting on you, Aoba!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.190
He's the only one we can depend on!

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.810
Yeah. Well, I'll go see him.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:04:59.770
Leave it to me.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:21.590
So, that's why we decided to ask you if you had any ideas...

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.760
Um... Yagen-sensei...

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.640
So I can do it?

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.600
Is it okay if I do it?

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:36.770
Y-Yes!

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.820
Just leave it to me!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:45.400
Um... This is all right, isn't it?

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.660
It's about this, Sensei.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.620
Wouldn't it be better if the protagonist acted a little more subdued?

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:58.750
Well then, let's try it out together.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:03.000
I've got to work hard to make up for Amamiya-san.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.010
Yes. So this part here is bright and cheerful, right?

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.390
I understand.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:25.940
See the power of my creativity. I'm all fired up!

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.490
BURNING!

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:32.080
Do your best Riku! Youth doesn't come twice!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:38.870
Let's make it great!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.410
Super Haunted House

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:38.870
All together!!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:40.170
Thanks for waiting!

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.920
I've brought all the materials we'll need!

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:43.250
All right then!

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:44.800
Let's get started right away!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.590
But will it be all right?

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:47.920
Can you use it, Mishi?

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:49.970
I'm not sure, but...

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:52.510
Well, it'll all work out somehow.

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:54.010
C'mon! Let's get started!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.760
Okay.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:57.560
Hey, Aoba.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:58.680
Come over here.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:06:59.850
All right.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:05.770
There we go.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:07.400
How's this, Doujima-chan?

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:08.820
Didn't I do a good job?

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.070
Hmph. You've still got a long way to go.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:12.200
What's <i>that?</i>

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:16.580
It's a devil. A yellow devil!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:18.790
A devil? Why?

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.920
Well, if we keep going at this rate, we'll be able to get all the props ready.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:23.920
Now we just have to do the interior.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:27.130
Yagen-sensei said that he'd do some of that himself, but...

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:28.760
I'll go check on him.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:30.840
We're counting on you, Aoba!

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:36.220
Well, first I'll have to check in with the committee.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.850
Then I'll go check on Yagen-sensei.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.270
Then I'll have to check on the signs...

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.560
Will Inukai-kun do that for me?

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:50.190
Inukai-kun,
Please take care of the signs for the
Super Haunted House!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:50.190
Aoba

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:51.740
Geez.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:53.660
What a bother.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.710
Now I've got to deliver these to all the classes.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:10.880
Aoba-kun's working hard.

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.260
I can't give up either.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:42.410
Amamiya-san. I'm working hard too, so...

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:04.440
Culture
Festival!

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:10.650
Three more days...

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:34.970
How about that?

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.340
Didn't I do a great job?

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.260
Length - 200 meters.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.220
Height - 30 meters.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:47.940
I used automated robots to build it, regulate the temperature, illuminate the interior, and control all the gimmicks.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:53.900
There is a special screen that monitors every angle of the building!

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.820
Has my magnificence rendered you speechless?

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:59.410
That's only natural.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:05.080
Um... Our diagram specified a length of twenty meters and a height of three meters...

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:10.920
It's a free bonus!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:11.500
Yay!

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.170
SAKURAI!

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:15.880
What's the meaning of this?

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:20.010
Now there's no room left for our events!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:19.640
That's...

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:21.430
How dare you!

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:25.970
Do you expect the baseball club's customers not to play "Drum Can Strike"?!

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.730
And what will become of our soba shop?!

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.110
A-All right!

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:34.940
We'll get some other areas ready for you, so please wait a little while!

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:36.940
Wh-What'll we do?

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:41.200
We don't have enough ghosts for a haunted house this big.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:43.660
We don't have enough decorations.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.870
Even if we keep making them now, the building's too high to fill up.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.080
But we don't have any materials left.

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:52.170
Geez! What are we gonna do?!

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:02.720
Toki-

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:05.850
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:08.850
This is a special bonus.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:11.230
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:30.620
Good, let's go.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:33.290
Y-Yeah.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.210
Hey!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.880
What are you up to?

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.510
Kasuga-san!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:42.470
Did I surprise you?

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.850
Up we go.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:50.430
What are you doing here so late at night?

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.310
I was on my way home from club.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.770
But never mind that.

00:11:57.860 --> 00:11:59.190
Why are <i>you</i>  sneaking around, Riku-kun?

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.570
Well, actually...

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.120
Megami-sama!

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.330
TL Note: "Megami" means "goddess."

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.330
Riku-kun?

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:15.000
Would you please summon some real ghosts for us during the Culture Festival?

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:15.900
Will you please.

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.000
Riku-kun! Are you serious?

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:19.460
I know what you're thinking.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:23.340
But it's the only way to make our project succeed!

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:27.390
But if we do that, we'll have to deal with that terrifying afro monster again!

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:28.680
Well...

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:31.850
Ghosts are my specialty, so...

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:32.850
Please do something!

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:36.400
Our whole class worked hard all day getting ready for the Culture Festival.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.480
Riku-kun...

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:39.400
I'm begging you!

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:42.150
Please lend us your power, Megami-sama!

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.200
Well...

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.820
There are some ghosts over there.

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:01.550
Yay! A festival!

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.840
I can't wait!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:07.550
I can scare humans as much as I want!

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.890
Sign says: Entrance

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:11.220
Entrance

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:09.050
I'm pretty good-looking, too.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.890
I wonder why they're so scared of us, anyway.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:15.310
There really are ghosties here.

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:16.710
I guess so.

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:18.690
All right, everyone.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.940
I'm counting on you!

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:22.650
Okay!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.320
You don't need to worry about them.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:28.870
They're all good ghosties.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:30.700
It's just that...

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:31.620
Just what?

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.540
They like playing tricks on people.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.750
WHAT?!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:37.920
Okay, ghosties!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.090
Kasuga missing dialogue, maybe that she's just mumbling random crap or maybe a dialogue

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:41.460
The same as kasuga, riku maybe saying just random crap

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:40.540
Get along with everyone!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:58.980
Finally. It's the day after tomorrow.

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:10.030
Will Aoba-kun like the dress?

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.000
What?

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:19.460
Super Haunted House

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:19.000
There aren't enough ghosts, but you fixed it somehow?

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.750
Yes, well...

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:22.590
What?

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.460
What kind of magic did you use?

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:27.880
Well, rather than magic, there's this person I know, and...

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:30.390
Do you know some ghosts or something?

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:34.310
No, I mean, some spirits... well, maybe a goddess!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:36.350
Well, who cares about the details at this point?

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:37.350
That's right.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:40.560
All that's left is the event tomorrow!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:41.730
I'm so excited!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.230
Yeah! I'll do it too, Aoba!

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.320
Y-Yeah.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:47.570
U-Um...

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:48.740
Aoba-san.

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.610
Yahoo, Riku-kun!

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:52.070
It looks like you're ready.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:53.700
Kasuga-san! Mina-chan!

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.740
Hey, do you think it'll be all right?

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:59.210
Yeah, for now at least.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.170
Then I'm sure it'll be fine!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.040
Go for it!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.130
Yeah.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:04.750
Um...

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.380
I brought some refreshments.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:09.010
You worked hard to get ready for the Culture Festival.

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:14.850
Entrance

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:12.220
Thank you, Mina-chan.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:14.970
Oh! Good going, Aoba-kun!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:16.810
Well, what did you expect?

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:21.440
Aoba-kun's the class hero. He managed to get all the work done.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:24.820
Oh no! I think I'm starting to fall in love with him!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.320
C-Come on!

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.900
Aoba's the most popular guy in school.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:31.490
We can't do anything about that today.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.950
Thanks to Riku-kun, the Culture Festival will go along smoothly.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.660
Aoba! You're a real man!

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:43.710
Drama Club Room

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.130
Wow!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.340
It's so beautiful!

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.630
It suits you perfectly!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:48.840
I knew you could do it.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.090
Um, Kurotokage-sensei...

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.800
Before the main event, I'd like to run a last dress rehearsal. Are you ready?

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:54.800
I'm counting on you.

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:55.930
U-Um...

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:57.560
Before that, I'd like to...

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:09.990
Entrance

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:04.520
Well, we should go see how things are going inside.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:05.440
Good idea.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.860
We should inspect the inside of the building.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:08.860
Yeah.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:09.940
Hey everyone!

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.120
My God!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.470
A-Amamiya-san!

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.220
She's simply stunning!

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:35.720
Amamiya-san! Is that your costume for the play?

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.800
Yeah. It suits you perfectly!

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:38.810
Thanks.

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:40.390
But never mind that. Are you ready?

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:41.930
Everything's ready!

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:43.060
I see.

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:45.060
Say, where's Aoba-kun?

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:47.440
Aoba's, um... Oh! He's over there!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:53.150
I'm counting on all of you for the festival tomorrow.

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:54.400
We'll all work hard.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.210
Oh, Sayuri!

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:07.460
Oh, Amamiya-san!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:10.300
We're finally ready. See?

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.880
It's ALL thanks to Aoba-kun!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.300
He's the hero of the Culture Festival! No doubt about it!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:19.010
Yeah. You can't argue with that.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:23.270
Well, you just need to relax and do your play.

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:30.940
What's wrong, Amamiya-san?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.190
It's nothing.

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:34.690
But anyway, good for you, right, Aoba-kun?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.660
You're popular with everyone.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.660
Why are you saying that all of a sudden?

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:39.700
It's nothing.

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:41.950
What do you mean, "It's nothing"?

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:42.740
What's wrong?

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:44.700
Like I said, it's nothing.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.960
But anyone can tell that you're acting strange, Amamiya-san!

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.250
It's not strange.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.460
But...

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:51.920
But what?

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.760
Why don't you just say what you mean?

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:02.390
Hey, Sayuri.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:04.020
Are you angry?

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:05.850
What's wrong?

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:06.730
This isn't like you.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:08.310
Something happened, didn't it?

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:10.310
Come on! Tell me what's wrong!

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:10.940
To hell with you!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:20.530
Ahh... Riku-kun! Amamiya-san went inside.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:21.490
Will she be all right in there?

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.200
EEEEKKK!

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.330
Amamiya-san!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:26.790
This is bad!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.460
I've gotta rescue her!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:29.870
What's wrong, Riku-kun?

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:30.630
You're in a panic.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.250
They're just props, aren't they?

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:35.090
It's not dangerous at all.

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.050
Entrance

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:37.340
A-Actually...

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:39.470
WHAT?!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:42.550
There are real ghosts in there?

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:44.220
Yeah.

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:47.020
Did you ask the goddess to help you?

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:48.020
Sorry.

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:50.020
I couldn't stop her either.

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.150
But that's...

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:52.520
That goes against all science!

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.900
No, we believe in them.

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:57.650
Yeah. It's different from last time.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.030
We had a bad experience with an afro monster.

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:02.070
Doujima-kun.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:03.240
Icchi.

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:05.490
Then there's no need to discuss it.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.040
We'll go rescue Amamiya-san!

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:08.830
Yeah.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.750
We'll get our revenge on that afro monster!

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:12.540
YEAH!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:15.920
All right, let's begin "Operation Rescue Sayuri."

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:19.380
The boys will search the interior and retrieve Sayuri as quickly as possible.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.130
This will be a hit-and-run operation.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.390
And while you're at it, you can report back on the safety of the interior.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:28.980
If there are real ghosts in there, it'll be a huge success for sure!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.890
All right. Begin the operation!

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.230
YEAH!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:34.440
Amamiya-san.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.400
We'll do whatever it takes to rescue you.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.460
How are things at your end?

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:55.920
Well, it's pretty dark over here.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:57.300
Yeah.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:00.130
Anyway, the interior's quite well made.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:01.510
Yeah.

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:04.090
Yagen-sensei's really good at this.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.260
It seems they don't like afros...

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:11.020
What was that?

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:17.820
Hey. What was that?

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:19.030
What happened?

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:21.650
Hey! Yuusuke!

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:22.570
Respond!

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:23.860
Yuusuke!

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:24.660
What's wrong?

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:32.710
It's a ghost!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:33.160
AAAAGGGGHHHH!!!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:34.750
No, not an afro!

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.210
Hey! What's wrong?

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:37.500
Did it really come out?

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:38.880
It couldn't be...

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.940
That last scream happened thirty minutes ago.

00:20:58.570 --> 00:20:59.940
They must've been completely wiped out.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:01.030
Oh no!

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.860
To be honest, I couldn't care less what happens to the boys, but Amamiya-san's still in there!

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:05.860
Wh-What'll we do now?

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.240
I finally found my way out.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.410
Eh... Sayuri?!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:12.660
What's wrong, everyone?

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.250
That's our line! Are you all right?

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:18.880
Yes. But never mind that. The inside looks wonderful!

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:21.000
The ghosts were so realistic!

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:21.960
I was really surprised!

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:24.670
So why did you scream earlier?

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.640
Oh, my dress got caught on something.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:28.680
And then I tore it.

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.430
I see.

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:33.390
I've got to fix it now.

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:34.180
See ya.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:41.980
It's scarier that she didn't realize anything.

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:43.990
In a way, she's another legend.

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:47.240
Aoba-san.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:49.030
Oh, Riku-kun!

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:51.160
Come on out! Hurry!

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.620
Sign says: Exit.

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:53.750
Exit

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:57.120
Amamiya-san!

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:03.550
Where the hell is the exit?!

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:11.010
It looks like they're all getting along really well.

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:12.810
I'm so glad.

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:36.540
As the morning sunlight streams through

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.710
I immediately start to think of you.

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:48.130
The moment our eyes first met

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:53.890
This love began.

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:59.850
This light illuminates our future

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:06.280
Because you're my destined one.

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:11.780
I start to smile.

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:16.830
This very feeling, I've been searching for it all along.

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:23.960
I have grasped this piece of a miracle which fell into this world.

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:29.720
I will run to your side, my love!

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:35.310
The two of us can overcome any obstacle, no matter how high.

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:42.060
Even though our love is still young, it's my treasure!

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:52.490
Next Episode Preview

00:23:49.900 --> 00:24:19.970
Tokimeki      Memorial

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:52.280
Oh! Kamina-san!

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:54.160
Did you hear? There's going to be a special guest at the Culture Festival!

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.950
Stop! That's meant to be a surprise!

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:57.580
Geez! How come?

00:23:57.660 --> 00:23:58.950
I'm going to the Culture Festival!

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:00.620
Like I said, that's supposed to be a secret!

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:02.170
Oh, what's the big deal?

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:03.290
At the Culture Festival...

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:03.630
NO!

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:05.420
I've kept it secret for so long now!

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:07.300
Yo! I'm Meta Ryuki!

00:24:07.590 --> 00:24:08.920
Watch us next week!

00:24:09.330 --> 00:24:11.720
Next on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:11.930 --> 00:24:13.230
An Exciting Culture Festival.

00:24:13.250 --> 00:24:14.140
Please watch it.

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:17.050
Huh? That just popped out...

00:24:17.200 --> 00:24:19.100
A-All my hard work's gone to waste!
